OL,3,GNEWSASocial care cuts included in plan 
OL,4,Ato save #18m                           
OL,6,FA local authority is facing #18m of    
OL,7,Fcuts to services, including savings in 
OL,8,Fadult social care and children's       
OL,9,Fservices.                              
OL,11,FThe Liberal Democrat-led Oxfordshire   
OL,12,FCounty Council will spend #782m on     
OL,13,Fproviding services next year, but      
OL,14,Fincreased demand and a reduction in    
OL,15,Ffunding from central government means  
OL,16,Fsavings are needed.                    
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
