OL,3,GNEWSASocial care cuts included in plan 
OL,4,Ato save #18m                           
OL,6,FProposals include #1m cuts to the      
OL,7,Fcouncil's home-to-school transport     
OL,8,Fservice and reducing levels of support 
OL,9,Ffor adults where a review of care      
OL,10,Fpackages shows they have been over     
OL,11,Fassessed.                              
OL,13,FDan Levy, the council's finance chief, 
OL,14,Fsaid "the blame for this situation lies
OL,15,Fsquarely at the doors of Whitehall".   
OL,16,FThe government said it was targeting   
OL,17,Ffunding to areas with the greatest     
OL,18,Fneed.                                  
